<view class="page-shell archive-page" style="padding-top:{{navBarTop}}px">
  <view class="native-nav archive-nav" style="height:{{navBarHeight}}px">
    <view class="nav-back" bindtap="onBack" aria-role="button" aria-label="返回">‹</view>
    <text class="nav-title">AI 演示档案馆</text>
    <view class="nav-spacer"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="archive-main">
    <view class="archive-hero">
      <text class="archive-kicker">AI DEMO ARCHIVE</text>
      <text class="archive-title">先看主作品，再翻历史。</text>
      <text class="archive-copy">纯 AI 婚礼全景是主作品；技术样片、观看模式和旧路演稿分别归档。内容没有减少，但不再把不同性质的页面铺成一地。</text>
      <view class="archive-stats"><view><text>1</text><text>件主作品</text></view><view><text>4</text><text>幕 AI 全景</text></view><view><text>3</text><text>类归档</text></view></view>
    </view>

    <view class="ai-feature" bindtap="onAiPano" aria-role="button" aria-label="打开纯 AI 婚礼全景">
      <view class="ai-collage"><view wx:for="{{aiScenes}}" wx:key="id"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view><text>{{item.number}} · {{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.place}}</text></view></view></view>
      <view class="ai-feature-copy"><text class="ai-badge">历史找回 · 纯 AI 生成</text><text class="ai-id">AI WEDDING PANORAMA · s900001</text><text class="ai-title">一场未曾拍摄的婚礼</text><text class="ai-copy">4 张 2:1 AI 全景与 8 张 AI 照片组成完整四幕：初见、誓言、共宴、尽兴。这里才是你记得的那套“纯 AI 全景图”。</text><text class="ai-go">进入完整 AI 全景展览 →</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="archive-current">
      <view><text>当前产品方向</text><text>把空间、时间线、全景与 TA 视角收进一套成品。</text></view>
      <view class="archive-current-actions"><button bindtap="onVision">理想成品</button><button bindtap="onStory">新版六幕</button></view>
    </view>

    <view class="archive-groups">
      <view class="archive-group {{openGroup === 'reference' ? 'archive-group--open' : ''}}">
        <view class="archive-group-toggle" data-group="reference" bindtap="onGroup"><view><text>技术对照</text><text>真实全景可漫游样片</text><text>用于检查环视、景深和照片钉点，不是 AI 生成。</text></view><text>{{openGroup === 'reference' ? '4 −' : '4 ＋'}}</text></view>
        <view class="archive-group-body" wx:if="{{openGroup === 'reference'}}"><scroll-view class="room-scroll" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="false"><view class="room-row"><view class="room-card {{activeRoomIndex === index ? 'room-card--active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{rooms}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRoom"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view><text>{{item.time}} · {{item.chapter}}</text><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.subtitle}}</text></view></view></view></scroll-view></view>
      </view>
      <view class="archive-group {{openGroup === 'modes' ? 'archive-group--open' : ''}}">
        <view class="archive-group-toggle" data-group="modes" bindtap="onGroup"><view><text>交互形态</text><text>同一段记忆的五种看法</text><text>旅程、时光轴、相册、机器回忆和一键成片。</text></view><text>{{openGroup === 'modes' ? '5 −' : '5 ＋'}}</text></view>
        <view class="archive-group-body" wx:if="{{openGroup === 'modes'}}"><view class="mode-grid"><view class="mode-card {{activeMode === item.id ? 'mode-card--active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{modes}}" wx:key="id" data-mode="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onMode"><text class="mode-icon">{{item.icon}}</text><view><text>{{item.meta}}</text><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.copy}}</text></view><text>→</text></view></view></view>
      </view>
      <view class="archive-group {{openGroup === 'pitches' ? 'archive-group--open' : ''}}">
        <view class="archive-group-toggle" data-group="pitches" bindtap="onGroup"><view><text>历史原稿</text><text>叙事、路演与研究页面</text><text>保留当时版本的重点，统一收进演示档案馆。</text></view><text>{{openGroup === 'pitches' ? '5 −' : '5 ＋'}}</text></view>
        <view class="archive-group-body" wx:if="{{openGroup === 'pitches'}}"><view class="pitch-grid"><view class="pitch-card" wx:for="{{pitches}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onPitch"><text>{{item.eyebrow}}</text><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.copy}}</text><text>打开演示 →</text></view></view></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="archive-preview" id="archivePreview" wx:if="{{previewVisible}}">
      <view class="preview-head"><view><text>正在查看 · {{activeModeInfo.meta}}</text><text>{{activeModeInfo.title}}</text></view><text>可操作预览</text></view>

      <view wx:if="{{activeMode === 'journey'}}">
        <view class="journey-route"><view class="{{activeRoomIndex === index ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{rooms}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRoom"><text>{{item.time}}</text><text>{{item.chapter}}</text></view></view>
        <view class="pano-card"><scroll-view scroll-x enhanced scroll-left="{{panoScrollLeft}}" scroll-with-animation><image src="{{activeRoom.image}}" mode="heightFix" /></scroll-view><view><text>{{activeRoom.time}} · {{activeRoom.chapter}}</text><text>{{activeRoom.title}}</text><text>{{activeRoom.subtitle}}</text></view></view>
        <view class="direction-row"><button class="{{panoScrollLeft === index * 420 ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{['正前','右侧','后方','左侧']}}" wx:key="*this" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onDirection">{{item}}</button></view>
        <text class="direction-label">{{panoDirection}} · {{activeRoom.title}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="preview-timeline" wx:if="{{activeMode === 'timeline'}}"><view wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="*this"><text>{{index < 2 ? '09:08' : index < 4 ? '12:18' : '18:06'}}</text><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" /><text>{{index < 2 ? '接亲' : index < 4 ? '仪式' : '宴席'}} · 视角 {{index + 1}}</text></view></view>

      <view class="preview-album" wx:if="{{activeMode === 'album'}}"><image wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="*this" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" /></view>

      <view class="preview-machine" wx:if="{{activeMode === 'machine'}}"><view wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="*this"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view><text>{{82 + (index * 7) % 16}}%</text><text>{{index % 3 === 2 ? '待复核' : '自动归位'}}</text><text>{{(index * 53) % 360}}°</text></view></view></view>

      <view class="preview-film" wx:if="{{activeMode === 'film'}}"><view wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="*this"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" /><text>0{{index + 1}}</text></view><view class="film-copy"><text>空间记忆 · 六镜故事板</text><text>短片结束以后，继续进入可以拖动和探索的共同空间。</text><button bindtap="onVision">进入理想成品</button></view></view>
    </view>

    <view class="archive-note"><text>档案说明：</text><text>纯 AI 婚礼作品明确标注为生成内容；技术对照使用真实 CC0 全景；“理想成品”代表当前产品方向。三者不再混写。</text></view>
  </view>
</view>
